 # Feature Matrix
 
+## OPEN LOOK editor scrolling (2026-11-25)
+
+The painted `code_edit` host includes an automatic native XView vertical
+scrollbar. Its logical-row range and thumb follow document changes, wheel
+and caret navigation, and resizing; native scrollbar requests change the
+viewport without moving the selection. Short documents hide the bar.
+
